 Elin https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bT5A8003u4pnJSJ_1K3Y_6muroF9Q5kP?usp=drive_link !!\n\nShe is a flower nymph born from a Chinese peony. She has a tragic past where her curiosity brought many deaths. She really likes anything nature related and especially love birds! She also has the ability to conjure flowers.\n\nFeel free to draw her as you like! \n\nThank you!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@On_niiiiiku130/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2314692, "client_id": 2934171, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2116aa8c/uploads/origins/f9b85334-28e6-44ec-8816-102ecb736bc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7dfb2ccf370679332222c8e471ee4a51", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2116aa8c/uploads/origins/f9b85334-28e6-44ec-8816-102ecb736bc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7dfb2ccf370679332222c8e471ee4a51, https://si.imgix.net/2116aa8c/uploads/origins/f9b85334-28e6-44ec-8816-102ecb736bc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef96fb3cbfe296cf1c8ca1c5ded76cb7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2116aa8c/uploads/origins/f9b85334-28e6-44ec-8816-102ecb736bc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08a9b54a93cbc2edf9b3ea5a01998567 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2116aa8c/uploads/origins/f9b85334-28e6-44ec-8816-102ecb736bc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e4e5801a86b5459e0d3d650ee65dee38", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2116aa8c/uploads/origins/f9b85334-28e6-44ec-8816-102ecb736bc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e4e5801a86b5459e0d3d650ee65dee38, https://si.